Each group completed the following training protocols three times per week:

HIIT1 group: 3 minutes of sliding followed by 2 minutes of rest, repeated for 4 sets; training intensity was maintained at 85% of maximal heart rate (HRmax) [ 28 ];

HIIT2 group: 4 minutes of sliding followed by 1 minute of rest, repeated for 4 sets; intensity matched that of the HIIT1 group [ 29 ];

MICT group: 20 minutes of continuous sliding at 70% HRmax [ 30 ].

